{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HYPC4yiQcRakB4SoEHhcYT","type":"tool_result","content":"total 9728\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 user  wheel      288 Nov  4 19:47 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 19:47 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     3331 Nov  4 19:47 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel    46817 Nov  4 19:47 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 19:47 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     1708 Nov  4 19:47 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 19:47 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 19:47 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel  4254678 Nov  4 19:47 scorer_in.npz\n\"\"\"Laya scorer helper. M: [n, 5, 1024] marker vectors (one per department option).\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np, torch\nDEPTS = [\"cards\", \"disputes\", \"transfers_topups\", \"fees_fx\", \"account_security\"]\ndef load(path):\n    d = np.load(path); return {k: d[k] for k in d.files}\ndef save(S, path):\n    np.savez(path, **S)\ndef gelu(x):\n    return 0.5 * x * (1 + torch.erf(torch.from_numpy(np.ascontiguousarray(x)) / np.sqrt(2)).numpy())\ndef logits(S, M):\n    mu = M.mean(-1, keepdims=True); var = M.var(-1, keepdims=True)\n    h = (M - mu) / np.sqrt(var + 1e-5) * S[\"ln_w\"] + S[\"ln_b\"]\n    z = (gelu(h @ S[\"W1\"] + S[\"b1\"]) @ S[\"W2\"] + S[\"b2\"])[..., 0]\n    i, e = 0, M\n    while f\"extra_W{i}\" in S:\n        e = e @ S[f\"extra_W{i}\"] + S[f\"extra_b{i}\"]\n        if f\"extra_W{i + 1}\" in S:\n            e = np.maximum(e, 0)\n        i += 1\n    return z + e[..., 0] if i else z\ndef predict(S, M):\n    return [DEPTS[i] for i in logits(S, M).argmax(-1)]\ntext\tcorrect\nMy PIN was blocked.\tcards\nI must change my PIN as soon as possible.\tcards\nWhat is the procedure of unblocking my PIN?\tcards\nI entered in the wrong PIN.  Please help me unlock my account.\tcards\nWhere can I change my PIN?\tcards\nI think my pin has been compromised, what do I do?\tcards\nCan I change my pin through the app?\tcards\nIf I am not in the country and I need to change my PIN, how can this be done?\tcards\nI'm in Austria right now, but I really need to change my PIN right now. Can I do this even though I'm in another country?\tcards\nWhat are the steps to change my PIN to something else?\tcards\nWhere can I update my pin number?\tcards\nCan I unblock my PIN in the app?\tcards\nIf my PIN number is rejected, how do I solve it?\tcards\nMy PIN has been blocked.\tcards\nCan someone help me unblock my pin?\tcards\nCan I reset my PIN if it is blocked?\tcards\nHow much would an extra card cost?\tcards\nPlease provide me with the restrictions of the disposable cards.\tcards\nwhat is going on, i have entered my passcode and its not working\taccount_security\nI can't find my card, it is lost.\tcards\nI have a new card and need to activate it\tcards\nIs there a charge for sending out more cards?\tcards\nCan I make a contactless payments?\tcards\nHow do I add a card on to the app?\tcards\nWhy haven't I gotten my new card?\tcards\nPlease assist me in activating the card.\tcards\nHow do I link an existing card?\tcards\nI would like to link my card to my account.\tcards\nIt's been a week since you issued me a card and I still didn't get it. Should I keep waiting?\tcards\nPlease tell me, do you use Visa or Mastercard?\tcards\ncan I use my card before identity verification?\taccount_security\nHow do I use disposable cards?\tcards\n\"\"\"Run frozen Laya on your own messages: python embed.py out.npz \"message 1\" \"message 2\" ...\nWrites M [n, 5, 1024]: the scorer input for each department option. Takes ~10 s to load.\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '<lab>/laya')\nimport numpy as np, laya_lab as L\na = L.load_agent()\nnp.savez(sys.argv[1], M=L.marker_vectors(a, sys.argv[2:]))\nprint(\"wrote\", sys.argv[1], len(sys.argv) - 2, \"messages\")\nstep1\nstep2","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6eec912b-7bc0-4263-9e21-2cd9f3856154","uuid":"07ce974f-c700-4386-b587-ef49